\title{BayesianBenter: Bayesian Estimation of the Benter Model for Rankings}
\description{
An efficient Gibbs sampler for Bayesian inference in the Benter model for ranking data, a generalization of the Plackett-Luce model that introduces stage-specific dampening (noise) parameters. Estimation uses exponential and alpha-stable data augmentation that preserves conjugacy, giving exact Gamma draws to worth parameters and MH updates of dampening parameters. Both complete and partial (top-R) rankings are supported.
